5,1,1,talk,May,,Let's make this interesting! I want to see if we're just repeating old mistakes. I'll start with the archives.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A prudent approach, May. I suspect the human element is often the most overlooked variable in these grand designs.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. I'm looking forward to working with you. I'm a bit worried about where the actual delays happen.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to be here with you all. I wonder who must give their blessing for these plans to move forward.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,Hello. I think it is important to understand the long-term financial commitments we are making.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, you're always so serious! But I agree, the ""human element"" is usually where the chaos starts.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"I prefer ""realistic"" over ""serious,"" May. I'll be looking into the staffing side of things.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Jonathan, do you think the budget affects the timing of the routes, or just the infrastructure?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, that is a very thoughtful question. Perhaps we can find the answer together as we look into the records.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Midori, I believe the funding structure often dictates the quality of the service more than the total amount.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,I'm feeling a bit mischievous. I'll dig into the ghosts of transit past to see what failed before.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"While you hunt for ghosts, I shall seek the living—or at least those who are currently overworked.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,I think I'll focus on the actual passenger experience and where the time is really spent.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I shall look into the committees and the hidden costs of the old structures. It is better to be safe.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will look into the ledger and the contractor fees to see the true cost of ownership.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
