35,2,1,talk,May,,"Well, it seems we have a habit of forgetting that some of our ""new"" ideas actually worked eight years ago!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,Fascinating. It appears our workforce is stretched to a point that would make a rubber band snap.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Midori,,I found that the delays aren't where people complain most. The connection times are the real problem.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"Oh dear, it seems the old station shells are hiding quite a few surprises for us, aren't they?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The numbers are concerning. We are paying more for ticketing fees than for the actual roads.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, does that mean the staff are too tired to implement the ""innovations"" the board loves so much?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Precisely, May. We are planning a feast while the kitchen staff are on strike—or simply exhausted.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shizue, do you think the issues in the shells are causing those connection delays I found?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is very possible, Midori. And I found that the ferry and rail offices aren't speaking the same language.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,It seems we are prioritizing contractor profits over the actual maintenance of the network.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,May,,"I'm just laughing at how the accessibility programme was half-undone. We just give up, don't we?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a tragedy in three acts: poor planning, insufficient staffing, and a complete lack of follow-through.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Midori,,"I just want to make sure we don't just fix the ""loudest"" problem. We need to fix the actual time loss.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"We must be gentle with the staff, but we must also be honest about who needs to say ""yes"" for this to work.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,I am worried that any plan we pick will just be a new way to hide the same debt.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
